								<wikidot:authorUserId>3146689</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I can't say that this speculation was uncalled for. I tried to build the first half of the story so it'd seem like it's about eating humans, because I felt like it would be the &quot;worst thing&quot; people would imagine with a setup like this. So this aspect is used to go in that direction for some time, and then turn into a much weirder territory. Glad you liked the reveal!</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
