ver"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/gee0765" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5376871&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1580838543" alt="gee0765" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5376871)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/gee0765" >gee0765</a></span> <strong>(<a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/mister-nobody">Mister Nobody</a>)</strong></li> <li><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tanhony" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=776854&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1580838543" alt="Tanhony" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=776854)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tanhony" >Tanhony</a></span> <strong>(<a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/ooo-ooo-ooo-ooo-ooo-ooo-ooo">Ooo ooo ooo ooo, ooo ooo ooo</a>)</strong></li> <li><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mistopheles" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5552305&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1580838543" alt="Mistopheles" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5552305)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mistopheles" >Mistopheles</a></span></li> </ul> <p>Also, thanks to folks from -RU's Discord who discussed this concept with me for a bit and gave some ideas.</p> <p><a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Fast_food_restaurant_Hesburger_in_Kajaani.JPG">Image</a></p> 
